    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438400/extras/944c6c288a56cc0f2d0a03a2973efd46.poster.avif?t=1743004274\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438400/extras/944c6c288a56cc0f2d0a03a2973efd46.webm?t=1743004274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438400/extras/944c6c288a56cc0f2d0a03a2973efd46.mp4?t=1743004274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It Sprawls</strong> is a casual city builder where you try to create the biggest city possible on a forever expanding hexagonal map - place housing, industry, and infrastructure such as railroads, to keep the expansion going for as long as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438400/extras/c79a254f85b0c644715329fe07431591.poster.avif?t=1743004274\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438400/extras/c79a254f85b0c644715329fe07431591.webm?t=1743004274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438400/extras/c79a254f85b0c644715329fe07431591.mp4?t=1743004274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start the game with a set of cards that can be used to place tiles, improve existing ones, or clear natural blockers for more expansion space. Every placed tile increases your score, and you can gain more cards from\u00a0<strong>upzoning</strong>\u00a0tiles by meeting their level-up requirement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: game may cause unconditional hatred towards parking lots.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438400/extras/944c6c288a56cc0f2d0a03a2973efd46.poster.avif?t=1743004274\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438400/extras/944c6c288a56cc0f2d0a03a2973efd46.webm?t=1743004274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438400/extras/944c6c288a56cc0f2d0a03a2973efd46.mp4?t=1743004274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It Sprawls</strong> is a casual city builder where you try to create the biggest city possible on a forever expanding hexagonal map - place housing, industry, and infrastructure such as railroads, to keep the expansion going for as long as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438400/extras/c79a254f85b0c644715329fe07431591.poster.avif?t=1743004274\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438400/extras/c79a254f85b0c644715329fe07431591.webm?t=1743004274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438400/extras/c79a254f85b0c644715329fe07431591.mp4?t=1743004274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start the game with a set of cards that can be used to place tiles, improve existing ones, or clear natural blockers for more expansion space. Every placed tile increases your score, and you can gain more cards from\u00a0<strong>upzoning</strong>\u00a0tiles by meeting their level-up requirement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: game may cause unconditional hatred towards parking lots.</p>",
